{"suttaId":"thag8.2","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Th","vriCode":"s0508m.mul","paras":[2157,2181],"vripara":"502"},"segments":{"thag8.2:0.4":"Sirimittattheragāthā","thag8.2:1.1":"“Akkodhanonupanāhī, amāyo rittapesuṇo;","thag8.2:1.3":"Sa ve tādisako bhikkhu, evaṃ pecca na socati.","thag8.2:2.1":"“Akkodhanonupanāhī, amāyo rittapesuṇo;","thag8.2:2.3":"Guttadvāro sadā bhikkhu, evaṃ pecca na socati.","thag8.2:3.1":"“Akkodhanonupanāhī, amāyo rittapesuṇo;","thag8.2:3.3":"Kalyāṇasīlo so [yo (syā.)] bhikkhu, evaṃ pecca na socati.","thag8.2:4.1":"“Akkodhanonupanāhī, amāyo rittapesuṇo;","thag8.2:4.3":"Kalyāṇamitto so bhikkhu, evaṃ pecca na socati.","thag8.2:5.1":"“Akkodhanonupanāhī, amāyo rittapesuṇo;","thag8.2:5.3":"Kalyāṇapañño so bhikkhu, evaṃ pecca na socati.","thag8.2:6.1":"“Yassa saddhā tathāgate, acalā suppatiṭṭhitā;","thag8.2:6.3":"Sīlañca yassa kalyāṇaṃ, ariyakantaṃ pasaṃsitaṃ.","thag8.2:7.1":"“Saṅghe pasādo yassatthi, ujubhūtañca dassanaṃ;","thag8.2:7.3":"‘Adaliddo’ti taṃ āhu, amoghaṃ tassa jīvitaṃ.","thag8.2:8.1":"“Tasmā saddhañca sīlañca, pasādaṃ dhammadassanaṃ;","thag8.2:8.3":"Anuyuñjetha medhāvī, saraṃ buddhāna sāsanan”ti.","thag8.2:8.5":"… Sirimitto thero …."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
